      "content": "Details of Kshethram:\nMoolavar: Mayakoothan\nThayaar: Kulaindaivalli Nachiyar\nVimanam: Anandanilaya Vimanam\nPushkarani: Perungulam Theertham\n\nTravel: This kshethram is one of the Nava Tirupati temples, located 11 km from Srivaikuntam.\n\nAzhwar Pasuram:\nNam Azhwar: 11 Pasurams",
